WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Veka bodlhela ra khale ra plastiki etlhelweni ka ximilana.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Tsema u susa ehansi ka bodlhela. Hlayisa xipfalo.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Boxa timbhovo titsongo ti nga ri tingani eka xipfalo, kutani u xi tlherisela.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Celela nkolo wu languta ehansi. Tlhelo leri pfulekeke ri sale ehenhla katsongo ka misava.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Ri tate hi le henhla. Mati ma thona hi timbhovo ta xipfalo lexi celeriweke.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Loko mati ma ri karhi ma hunguteka ebodlheleni, ma hangalaka emisaveni leyi rhendzeleke timitsu.
